g-2\">2</div>\n              <div class=\"level-text\">芯片设计<br><span class=\"level-sub\">(无晶圆厂)</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 芯片设计]</div>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"role-text\">使用IP设计芯片，<br>但不生产</div></td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">NVIDIA</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">AMD</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">BROADCOM</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">Qualcomm</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">MARVELL</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">MACOM</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">NXP</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"ai-role-text\">打造高性能芯片<br>(GPU、CPU、ASIC、<br>SoC、网络芯片等)</div></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"level-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"level-left\">\n              <div class=\"level-num bg-3\">3</div>\n              <div class=\"level-text\">晶圆制造<br><span class=\"level-sub\">(代工)</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 晶圆厂]</div>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"role-text\">在晶圆上制造芯片，<br>使用先进制程</div></td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">tsmc</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">UMC</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">GlobalFoundries</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">intel</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"ai-role-text\">最资本密集的环节，<br>将设计变为现实</div></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"level-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"level-left\">\n              <div class=\"level-num bg-4\">4</div>\n              <div class=\"level-text\">设备<br><span class=\"level-sub\">(生产设备)</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 生产设备]</div>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"role-text\">提供制造芯片所需<br>的机器和工具</div></td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">ASML</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">APPLIED MATERIALS</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">Lam RESEARCH</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">KLA+</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">Onto innovation</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"ai-role-text\">支撑芯片制造的<br>每一步，是进入<br>的高门槛环节</div></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"level-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"level-left\">\n              <div class=\"level-num bg-5\">5</div>\n              <div class=\"level-text\">封装与测试<br><span class=\"level-sub\">(OSAT)</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 封装测试]</div>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"role-text\">封装、打包并测试<br>芯片以确保可用</div></td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">Amkor Technology</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">ASE</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">FormFactor</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"ai-role-text\">先进封装是AI芯片<br>(HBM、2.5D/3D等)<br>的关键瓶颈</div></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"level-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"level-left\">\n              <div class=\"level-num bg-6