       <div class=\"level-text\">连接与网络</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 网络连接]</div>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"role-text\">在芯片、系统和<br>数据中心之间<br>高速传输数据</div></td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">LUMENTUM</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">MARVELL</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">ciena</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">COHERENT</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">CREDO</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"ai-role-text\">高速连接是AI<br>基础设施的<br>关键骨干</div></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"level-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"level-left\">\n              <div class=\"level-num bg-9\">9</div>\n              <div class=\"level-text\">系统与基础设施</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[Icon: 服务器]</div>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"role-text\">将芯片集成到服务器、<br>系统和硬件解决方案</div></td>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">DELL Technologies</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">Hewlett Packard Enterprise</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">TTM Technologies</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"logo-row\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">NOKIA</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">CELESTICA</span>\n            <span class=\"placeholder logo-ph\">SMCI</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td><div class=\"ai-role-text\">将芯片变为可部署<br>的企业、云和AI<br>基础设施</div></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>\n          <div class=\"level-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"level-left\">\n              <div class=\"level-num bg-10\"